---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: ShadowFilteringMethod · 对象关系
  accDescr: 当前对象及全部直接关联对象。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_component fill:#F1F5F2,stroke:#4B8060,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_read stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: rounded, label: "**ShadowFilteringMethod**<br/>选择相机阴影边缘的滤波方式。" }
  class n0 node_component
  n1@{ shape: rounded, label: "**bevy​_​pbr::render::light::extract​_​**<br/>**shadow​_​filtering​_​method**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​pbr ↗：批量同步实体的<br/>阴影过滤方式。" }
  class n1 node_system
  class n1 external_node
  n2@{ shape: rounded, label: "**bevy​_​pbr::render::mesh::check​_​views​_​**<br/>**need​_​specialization**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​pbr ↗：汇总视图渲染特<br/>性并检测管线配置变化。" }
  class n2 node_system
  class n2 external_node
  n0 e0@--> n1
  class e0 edge_read
  n0 e1@--> n2
  class e1 edge_read
  e0@{ curve: basis }
  e1@{ curve: basis }
